  "body": "Titles have now been issued.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Bucklands Beach’s most desirable locations, Home 1 at 198 Bucklands Beach Road combines generous family living, premium finishes and future flexibility just moments from Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 145sqm across two levels, this beautifully considered home has been designed to appeal equally to families seeking a quality home in the Macleans College zone and downsizers wanting space, comfort and long-term practicality.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is centred around easy everyday living, with a generous lounge flowing naturally into the open-plan kitchen and dining area. A 2.7m stud height creates an immediate sense of openness and volume, while large doors extend the living onto generous hardwood decking — ideal for BBQs, outdoor dining and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen forms the heart of the home, combining quality cabinetry, generous workspace and a layout that connects naturally with both the dining and living areas.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms provide excellent flexibility for family life, guests or working from home. The master suite includes a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while three additional bedrooms are supported by a beautifully finished family bathroom.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage incorporates the laundry, while lift provision gives the home valuable future flexibility for buyers planning ahead.\r\n\r\nFinished in a premium combination of Nu-Wall aluminium cladding, weatherboard and brick, Home 1 has been designed for lasting quality and easy-care coastal living in one of East Auckland’s most tightly held neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\n- Titles issued\r\n- Approximately 145sqm floor area\r\n- Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n- Premium designer kitchen\r\n- Generous open-plan dining and living\r\n- 2.7m stud height on the lower level\r\n- Seamless flow to generous hardwood decking\r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms with rainhead showers\r\n- Single internal-access garage\r\n- Laundry incorporated within garage\r\n- Lift provision for future accessibility\r\n- Premium Nu-Wall aluminium, weatherboard and brick exterior\r\n- Moments from Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach\r\n- Located in the sought-after Macleans College zone\r\n- Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact the Urban Haus team.\r\n\r\nFor new releases, project updates and behind-the-scenes content, follow @urbanhausnz on Instagram and Facebook.",
